// CHECK: adapters.pia:28:5: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: adapters.pia:9:31: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: adapters.pia:34:1: proved: 'alike<pixel, Same = by_red>' is an instance of the generic proof of 'alike' [generic]
// CHECK: adapters.pia:9:31: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: adapters.pia:34:1: proved: 'alike<u8>' is an instance of the generic proof of 'alike' [generic]
// CHECK: adapters.pia:9:31: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: adapters.pia:34:1: proved: 'alike<u8, Same = always>' is an instance of the generic proof of 'alike' [generic]
// CHECK: 10 proved, 0 failed, 0 skipped
